Hi,

I would like to stop accepting non-bug-fix patches for v4.13 and get
the last pull requests posted by the end of this week. This is in order
for them to be sent before the release of v4.12-rc6, the deadline set by the
ARM SoC maintainers.  As patches should ideally progress from the renesas
tree into linux-next before sending pull requests there is a few days lead
time involved.

I intend to begin queueing up patches for v4.14 as new patches are ready.
